class Solution {
    public void setZeroes(int[][] matrix) {

        int col0 = 1;
        int n = matrix.length;
        int m = matrix[0].length;

        for(int i = 0; i < n; i++){
            for(int j = 0; j < m; j++){
                if(matrix[i][j] == 0){
                    matrix[i][0] = 0;

                    if(j != 0)
                        matrix[0][j] = 0;
                    else
                        col0 = 0;
                }
            }
        }

        for(int i = 1; i < n; i++){
            for(int j = 1; j < m; j++){
                if(matrix[i][j] != 0){
                    if(matrix[0][j] == 0 || matrix[i][0] == 0)
                        matrix[i][j] = 0;
                }
            }
        }

        if(matrix[0][0] == 0){
            for(int j = 0; j < m; j++){
                matrix[0][j] = 0;
            }
        }

        if(col0 == 0){
            for(int i = 0; i < n; i++){
                matrix[i][0] = 0;
            }
        }
    }
}


notes:

| Approach                       | Time         | Space    | Interview Value     |
| ------------------------------ | ------------ | -------- | ------------------- |
| Brute force modify immediately | O((nm)(n+m)) | O(1)     | Bad                 |
| Row + column arrays            | O(nm)        | O(n+m)   | Good                |
| HashSet                        | O(nm)        | O(n+m)   | Good                |
| **First row/column marker**    | **O(nm)**    | **O(1)** | **Best / Expected** |
